BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mDfjqvIHpOvzYwVPxZOI@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:PES Practice Practical
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:Hey all\, Cardiology Club and IM Club will be holding the PES Mock Practical on November 11th from 6:00-8:15 PM in the OMM lab. This is a great opportunity to practice your skills and get tips from M2’s prior to your practical. \n\nSignup will be open to all members of either club (Cardiology Club or IM club) who have paid dues. Please fill your name in your preferred timeslot. \n\nPriority signup for members will be open from 10/28 to 11/4. \nSignup for non-members will be from 11/4 to 11/10 and will cost $15. \n\nNote that your name will be erased if you are not an official member of Cardiology Club or Internal Medicine club. \n\nIf you have any questions reach out to patrick.sohn@midwestern.edu or abigail.valicevic@midwestern.edu. \n\nSign-up link: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1maxn7QTcABtbPoKciXRCmOtgyrYQJVzxvK6KOA_3Myc/edit?usp=sharing\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378007
DTSTART:20261112T000000Z
DTEND:20261112T021500Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:uF1C8PKSSDJvJSzoA9jK@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:SAVMA Pickleball Tournament
LOCATION:Rec Center Gym AND Outdoor Basketball Courts\,
DESCRIPTION:Kick off winter quarter with a fun\, competitive 2v2 pickleball tournament! Teams of two are welcome\, and significant others can participate as long as one teammate is a current MWU student. All skill levels are welcome\, and matching outfits are encouraged! Registration is $20 per team ($10 per person)\, with some exciting prizes for the top three placing teams. Tournament will be held on campus on the basketball courts and in the rec center\, with pool play and bracket-style competition. The event will take place December 4th–6th\, with the goal of wrapping up by Saturday if possible. Enjoy concessions\, a bake sale\, and other goodies throughout the event. Come compete\, have fun\, and show off your team spirit!\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378012
DTSTART:20261204T230000Z
DTEND:20261207T020000Z
END:VEVENT
